      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHEEKY MILA (4) flew the lids off the inside draw with a fast early split last time and went on to clock 24.08 when a half a length winner over 425m at Bendigo. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. JETSTREAM ICON (2) goes very well this course and distance starting 11 times for four wins and five minors. Hit the frame latest (23.80) when second at Bendigo in a Free For All. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. SCOTT GREYSCALE (8) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (24.03) at Bendigo behind Greysynd Clyde in a Grade 4/5. Has the pace to be prominent. Has a solid record from this box including three wins and a minor placing. Bold showing expected. MAGIC LOKI (1) can measure up with the right run.",
